OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FIt will be a dry and bright
OL,6,Fstart to the day, but cloud will
OL,7,Fgradually increase through the
OL,8,Fmorning. A little patchy light rain is
OL,9,Fpossible during the afternoon. Breezy,
OL,10,Fespecially near the coasts.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FA cloudy and rather windy
OL,13,Fnight will then follow with a little
OL,14,Frain possible over northern coasts and
OL,15,Fhigher ground. A rather mild night for
OL,16,Fall.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
