OL,3,GSouth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FWinds easing on Saturday,
OL,6,Fbut staying cloudy for all. Patchy
OL,7,Foutbreaks of rain are likely,
OL,8,Fespecially in the west and over high
OL,9,Fground. Feeling rather muggy.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FTurning
OL,12,Fmostly dry from Sunday although
OL,13,Fremaining rather cloudy. Some bright
OL,14,For sunny spells developing at times
OL,15,Fand turning a little warmer too.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
